# Public access key for the Web3Forms-backed contact form on /contact.
#
# The destination email address (where contact submissions are delivered)
# is configured server-side in the Web3Forms dashboard. It is NOT stored
# in this repository or shipped to the browser. Only this opaque access
# key — which is safe to be public — is sent client-side.
#
# 1. Sign up at https://web3forms.com (free tier)
# 2. Create a form and set the destination email in their dashboard
# 3. Copy the access key here and into the Cloudflare Pages env vars
#
# Variable name must start with PUBLIC_ so Astro exposes it to the browser.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
